  <string name="T_for_a_first_home_a_month_is_50_to_1_500_and_the_lo">For a first home. A month is 50 € to 1 500 €, and the loan wants at least 20 months. Pauses are allowed, so a missed month is not a failure. S-Pankki pays 1%% while you save. Another 4%% is paid when you buy the home, for the year you started and up to five calendar years after that. Both are tax-free. The extra interest is paid at the purchase. It is not a monthly forecast, and it is not paid on money you took out before then. Opening the account happens with S-Pankki. This screen does not open one.</string>
  <string name="T_four_ways_to_save_send_bonus_to_a_fund_set_aside_0">Four ways to save. Send Bonus to a fund. Set aside 0,50 € to 5 € on each debit-card payment. Move a monthly sum. Add extra when you want. The funds can fall. This design does not predict them. October’s Bonus stays on S-Tili unless you send the next one.</string>
